{"kind": "mod", "id": 1553, "name": "Open The Damn Context Menu - Open the Context Menu While Searching", "slug": "open-the-damn-context-menu-open-the-context-menu-while-searching", "teaser": "Finally you can open the context menu while you search containers.", "owner_name": "JDogg", "downloads": 19421, "favourites": 0, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": null, "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-07T16:58:58.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-07-13T05:41:29.000000Z", "published_at": "2024-07-13T05:41:29.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.10.0", "latest_version": "1.0.2", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p><strong>Want to reload, unload mags, or inspect while searching? While now you can!</strong></p>\n<p>Very simple mod that allows for you to use the context menu normally while searching.</p>\n<p>I have <strong>not</strong> experienced any busy hands issues during my playing and testing. But if you do, and think it could be related to the context menu please let me know.</p>\n<p><strong>Install:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Extract to the BepInEx\\Plugins folder</li>\n<li>If updating from v1.0.0 please delete the old dll before updating.</li>\n<li>Make sure to use the correct version for your instance</li>\n</ul>\n<p>I don’t play EFT anymore but wanted to keep this updated. I’ve done some testing but lmk if there are problems!</p>\n<p>This is my first mod so please let me know of any bugs / issues / incompatibilities.</p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.0.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.3", "content_length": null, "downloads": 449, "published_at": "2024-07-13T05:41:29.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1553/open-the-damn-context-menu-open-the-context-menu-while-searching/1.0.0", "github_url": null, "external